┃g l                │ FocusLog           │ Focus message log                                                                                                   ┃
┃g q                │ FocusQueue         │ Focus queue                                                                                                         ┃
┃g f                │ FocusFiles         │ Focus the last file list                                                                                            ┃
┃ctrl-x 1           │ FocusRegion1       │ Focus the quickconnect bar (region 1)                                                                               ┃
┃ctrl-x 2           │ FocusRegion2       │ Focus the local tree (region 2)                                                                                     ┃
