┃ctrl-x 6           │ FocusRegion6       │ Focus the message log (region 6)                                                                                    ┃
┃ctrl-x 7           │ FocusRegion7       │ Focus the queue (region 7)                                                                                          ┃
┃ctrl-k             │ FocusQuickconnect  │ Focus the quickconnect bar (opens the dialog when the bar is hidden)                                                ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                              ┃
┃View                                                                                                                                                          ┃
┃ctrl-l             │ ToggleLog          │ Show/hide message log                                                                                               ┃
┃ctrl-x j           │ ToggleQueuePane    │ Show/hide queue                                                                                                     ┃
┃ctrl-e             │ ToggleTree         │ Show/hide directory trees                                                                                           ┃
┃ctrl-x q           │ ToggleQuickconnect │ Show/hide quickconnect bar                                                                                          ┃
┃g x                │ SwapPanes          │ Swap local and remote sides                                                                                         ┃
