┃z 3                │ LayoutWidescreen   │ Layout: widescreen                                                                                                  ┃
┃.                  │ ToggleHidden       │ Show/hide hidden files                                                                                              ┃
┃C                  │ ColumnMenu         │ Columns                                                                                                             ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                              ┃
